{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6ae7e3a6-931e-80ce-92fb-0c07dd746bc9",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T09:07:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Liam Gallagher",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:05:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, good morning!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:05:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Beth. Hi, I am calling about the February vacation week camp. Do you have one this year, for the school break?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:05:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We do. It runs the week of school vacation, Monday through Friday. Are you looking for a child to sign up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:06:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, my grandson. He is seven. Sorry, one second, he is showing me a video on the phone, a dog on a skateboard, and I am not looking at the road. I am parked, do not worry, parked!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:06:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, a skateboarding dog is not worth a ticket. Seven is right in the range for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:06:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, great. And what is the cost? For the whole week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:06:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's priced per week, and there's usually a different rate for Newport residents. I'd rather you get the exact amount off the registration page or I can have it sent to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:06:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is there, how do you say, a sibling thing? A discount?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:06:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sometimes, yes. Do you mean a break for a second child?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:06:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly, a break. Okay, that is a new one for me, thank you. He has a cousin, maybe she comes too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:06:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then I'll note both kids. Do you want me to email the flyer and the form?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:07:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Or you can call me back, four zero one, five five five, zero one seven two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:07:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0172. Your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:07:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Liam Gallagher. Like the singer, but no singing from me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:07:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Liam, I'll get that info out to you today. Spots do go fast after a snowy weekend like this, everybody's stuck inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:07:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the nor'easter, it was a lot. Everybody wants out of the house. Thank you, Beth, have a good day!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:07:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Liam. Bye now!"
    }
  ],
